T</em></strong><strong>, IN THEATERS &amp; DEBUTING EXCLUSIVELY ON PRIME </strong>\nOn October 20, 1967, Roger Patterson captured 59 seconds of film showing a creature walking through the Northern California woods-footage that became the most analyzed and debated in history. Fifty-nine years later, a reel of 16mm film discovered in a safe changes everything.\n\n“Capturing Bigfoot” reveals the untold story behind the world’s greatest mystery, told for the first time by Patterson’s own son and the people who were there.\n<h4>Share This Story!</h4><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fradiomankato.com%2Fclint-patterson-son-of-roger-patterson-who-filmed-bigfoot-marq-evans-director-of-documentary-capturing-bigfoot%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i></a><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/post?text=Clint%20Patterson%2C%20son%20of%20Roger%20Patterson%20who%20filmed%20Bigfoot%20%26%20Marq%20Evans%2C%20director%20of%20documentary%20CAPTURING%20BIGFOOT&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fradiomankato.com%2Fclint-patterson-son-of-roger-patterson-who-filmed-bigfoot-marq-evans-director-of-documentary-capturing-bigfoot%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fradiomankato.com%2Fclint-patterson-son-of-roger-patterson-who-filmed-bigfoot-marq-evans-director-of-documentary-capturing-bigfoot%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i></a><a><i></i></a><a href=\"https://radiomankato.com/trans-siberian-orchestra-guitarist-al-pitrelli-10-29-26/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">The Morning Blend</a><h4><a href=\"https://radiomankato.com/trans-siberian-orchestra-guitarist-al-pitrelli-10-29-26/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Trans Siberian Orchestra Guitarist Al Pitrelli 10-29-26</a></h4><a>October 29, 2026</a>\n<a href=\"https://radiomankato.com/blue-earth-county-sheriff-jeff-wersal-10-28-2026/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\